{"id":"tranquilamente","lemma":"tranquilamente","pos":"adv","rank":4189,"glosses":["calmly; tranquilly"],"ipa":"/tɾanˌkilaˈmente/","order":4190,"examples":[{"text":"Esperamos allí tranquilamente.","en":"We waited there quietly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514791","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Parece que el bebé duerme tranquilamente.","en":"The baby seems to be sleeping soundly.","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},null]},{"text":"El profesor se lavó tranquilamente las manos.","en":"The professor calmly washed his hands.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"professor"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to wash","l":"lavar"},null,{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"hand","l":"mano"}]}]}